From 0b9262bbdfbf5d5409b2ddff160b0dbf12926c1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guan Xuetao <gxt@pku.edu.cn>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 05:15:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] DADAO: Add AsmParser, CodeEmitter, InstPrinter, and
 AsmBackend

- Implement DADAOAsmParser for assembly parsing
- Implement DADAOMCCodeEmitter for instruction encoding
- Implement DADAOMCInstPrinter for assembly output
- Implement DADAOAsmBackend with fixup support
- Add DADAOFixupKinds.h for PC-relative fixups
- Add TableGen backends: -gen-asm-matcher, -gen-asm-writer, -gen-subtarget
- All 178 M1 instructions supported
- Branch/jump fixups: imms = (target - current) >> 2 (no +4 pipeline offset)
